   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "As much as",
   "texto": [
    "To say that two things are the same is used **so** + adjective + **wie**: **Er ist so alt wie ich** (he is as old as me).",
    "To say they are not the same: **nicht so … wie**: **Der Bus ist nicht so schnell wie der Zug** (the bus is not as fast as the train)."
